/a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 16 (page does not exist)\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 17 (page does not exist)\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 18 (page does not exist)\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 20 (page does not exist)\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 21 (page does not exist)\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 22 (page does not exist)\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 23 (page does not exist)\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 24 (page does not exist)\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_25&